# NOTE: src/api/generated is deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored. The README
# promises that `npm install && npm run dev` is enough to run the app, which is
# only true if the generated client ships with the repo -- regenerating it
# requires a configured Python backend. Refresh it with `npm run generate:api`.

